# What the build context does not need — and, more to the point, what it must
# not pick up from a working copy. src/Prdb.Ordeno.Host/wwwroot is produced by
# the frontend stage; a laptop's older copy of it winning over that stage would
# put an image together from two different commits.

.git
.github
.config
.local
docs
tests

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
src/Prdb.Ordeno.Host/wwwroot/

**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/TestResults/
**/*.user

# The image build reads none of these, and each one of them invalidates the
# context when it changes.
*.md
*.slnx
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
